ontacts and tracked roomscale movement, and recovered hockey motion integration. Original arenas, authored assets and identities, the existing Hurricane VR/Final IK rig and the authoritative puck impulse owner are preserved.\n\nFrontend and local offline play remain independent of network sign-in. Explicit online actions use player-hosted Unity Netcode with selected EOS P2P connectivity, lobby discovery and RTC voice, with real Meta sign-in and application-entitlement admission. Failed sign-in can retry from the server browser; active matches retain their admitted account identity. Free catalog access, local saved loadouts and unranked play are supported; trusted ranked result writes remain unavailable.\n\nThe current build receipt records the exact native checks, inspected renders and known limits. Carry, pass and goalie regressions remain open; selected checks do not establish whole-game acceptance. The saved Rapid Fire targeted-hit check failed after an accepted shot and normal miss/return; later lane assertions were not reached, and fixture versus runtime cause remains unresolved. Real Quest cold startup, controller and headset feel, sustained performance and two-account cross-network behavior require the recorded outstanding validation. The matching APK and every required same-build OBB are verified for integrity and pairing. Private BETA draft only.", "created_date": 1791863494, "id": "28518975674440799", "version": "0.1.0-beta.620", "version_code": 620, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28518972631107770"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7828614980570171", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28518975674440799"}, "release_status": "RELE